{
  "slug": "token-wise",
  "name": "Token Wise",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that routes text-heavy tasks to the right Claude model — saving tokens without sacrificing quality.\n\nWhy\nPlanning, CLAUDE.md generation, README writing, and PRDs don't need Opus when you're just structuring content. token-wise intercepts these tasks and runs them on Sonnet or Haiku instead, switching back to your session model automatically when done.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `claude-md-haiku` (Generate or update CLAUDE.md using Haiku (fastest, most cost-efficient)), `claude-md-opus` (Generate or update CLAUDE.md using Opus (highest quality)), `claude-md-sonnet` (Generate or update CLAUDE.md using Sonnet (balanced quality and cost)), `plan-haiku` (Generate a project plan using Haiku (fastest, most cost-efficient)), `plan-opus` (Generate a project plan using Opus (highest quality, deep reasoning)), `plan-sonnet` (Generate a project plan using Sonnet (balanced quality and cost)), `prd-haiku` (Generate a PRD or feature spec using Haiku (fastest, most cost-efficient)), `prd-opus` (Generate a PRD or feature spec using Opus (highest quality, deep reasoning)), and 4 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install token-wise@claude-community` from `vivek-cactus/token-wise`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Vivek Saurabh"
  },
